## Workspace Subscription

Events must be scoped by Workspace.

A client connected for Workspace A must not receive Area events for
Workspace B.

Conceptually:

Workspace A:
  Client A1
  Client A2

Workspace B:
  Client B1

Area update in Workspace A:

A1 <- event
A2 <- event
B1 <- NOTHING

Explain how subscription membership will be represented in the
single-instance implementation.

Do not implement Workspace authorization yet.

Workspace routing and authorization are separate concerns.

