## Event Contract

Review DESIGN.md and use the documented event schema.

At minimum evaluate whether an event needs:

- event type
- workspaceId
- areaId
- currentVersion
- persisted Area snapshot
- timestamp

Prefer enough information for the client to determine what changed without
making unnecessary REST requests.

But do not invent fields not justified by DESIGN.md.

The event must represent the authoritative POST-COMMIT state.

For DELETE, determine whether the event contains:

- deleted Area snapshot;
- only Area identity/version;
- another documented representation.

For RESTORE, ensure the event represents the newly created current version,
not the historical source version number.

