## Reconnect / Missed Events

WebSocket delivery is best-effort.

Task 07 does not need durable event replay.

On:

- initial connection;
- reconnection after disconnect;
- detected connection recovery;

the client should be able to synchronize through REST.

Propose the simplest mechanism using the existing viewport endpoint.

Do not implement:

- Kafka;
- durable WebSocket queues;
- event replay;
- event log;
- sequence recovery protocol.

