## History Interaction

If the History panel is open and a real-time Area event arrives for that
Area, do not silently change the captured expectedVersion used for Restore.

Otherwise OCC protection would be bypassed.

Propose the simplest behavior, likely:

- leave the open History interaction stale;
- restore attempt receives VERSION_CONFLICT;
- existing Task 06 conflict handling reloads authoritative state.

Do not build live-updating History unless required.

