## Frontend Manual Verification

The completed Task 07 should support this manual scenario:

1. Open the same Workspace in Browser/Tab A and Browser/Tab B.
2. In A, create an Area.
3. B sees the persisted Area without manual refresh.
4. In A, edit the Area.
5. B sees the persisted update.
6. In A, delete the Area.
7. B sees it disappear.
8. In A, restore it.
9. B sees it reappear.
10. Disconnect/reconnect B.
11. B resynchronizes authoritative viewport state through REST.

Also test:

12. Start editing Area in B.
13. Update the same Area in A.
14. B must not lose its unsaved edit.
15. Saving stale edit in B must still produce VERSION_CONFLICT.

